{"seq":2,"slug":"in-plato","title":"In Plato","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/socrates/major-works/in-plato","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-apology","title":"《申辩篇》","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/socrates/major-works/in-plato/the-apology","wordCount":1610,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"the-early-dialogues","title":"早期对话录","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/socrates/major-works/in-plato/the-early-dialogues","wordCount":1581,"readingTime":7}],"introHtml":"<p>本章考察记述苏格拉底最重要的文献——柏拉图的对话录。《申辩篇》记述了苏格拉底受审时的申辩，被公认为最能反映真实苏格拉底的文献之一，蕴含着&quot;未经省察的人生不值得过&quot;等不朽箴言；柏拉图的早期对话录，则围绕各种德性展开，生动展现了苏格拉底的诘问方法与&quot;自知无知&quot;的精神。</p>\n"}